# QA (M1 Stage 1), fixed by D-038: the Residenzbrunnen prop is drawn as one
# 5x3 block over cols 190-194 (top at y 192 across the whole width); the tiles
# under it used to be stepped (only 191-193 3 high, the outer columns 190 and
# 194 a 1-high rim), so Resi could drop "into" the drawn fountain at col 194
# and the Fiaker ran her over. Now all five columns are solid at the drawn
# height: she jumps up onto the fountain top, walks right until she stands
# entirely over col 194 (x 3105-3117), brakes and stays on top at y 170 while
# the Fiaker telegraphs and charges through underneath (game-design.md:
# "Residenzbrunnen (3 tiles high) ... a safe place to let it pass").
level  = salzburg
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 no_event=Died state=playing
expect = player_y<=170 player_x>=3104
